{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、転ぶ女。若月。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこ♪若月の写メは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壁から蛇口出てるとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言わないの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/12/3772574/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は見えないようにしたから(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼本日の写メ ドーン／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/12/3772574/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけではなじまりました、始まりましたと書きたかったのによそ見して打ってたら鼻血まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のブログは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜最近、『なるほど!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と妙に納得してしまったこと。〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つ目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"娘『トイレいってくる！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母『'お'をつけなさい!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"娘『トイレいってくるお。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母『............異例ね。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まぁ、だいたい合ってるけどね(笑))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２つ目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生徒『先生俺受験やる気でないっす』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生『じゃぁ、例えば君が受験をせずに何もしないまま大人になって30歳位にあぁ、あの時受験していればと後悔している所にドラえもんが来て、タイムマシンに乗せてくれて過去に戻った。そう、今人生のやり直しをしようと戻ってきたと考えてごらんよ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生徒『あ...頑張ろう。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生『そう、その調子。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(こ...れ...は...。こんなこといってくれる先生素敵すぎる。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３つ目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある看板が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古くなって少し剥げていた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『俺がやらなきゃ誰がやる!!!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という文字が力強く書かれていたが『誰が』の『が』の濁点が剥げていたせいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『俺がやらなきゃ誰かやる！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ととてつもなくやる気がないものになっていた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本語とは そういうものだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(点１つでこんなにも違ってしまうなんて。日本語は深い)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４つ目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『一年生になったら』という曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達100人作るのに何故か富士山の上でおにぎりを食べると